     Definition of corresponding orbitals and the diradical character in broken symmetry DFT calculations on spin coupled systems
     J. Phys. Chem. Solids 2004 65(4), 781-785
     doi.org/10.1016/j.jpcs.2003.11.015
  4. Neese, F.; Wennmohs, F.; Hansen, A.; Becker, U.
     Efficient, approximate and parallel Hartree-Fock and hybrid DFT calculations. A 'chain-of-spheres' algorithm for the Hartree-Fock exchange
     Chem. Phys. 2009 356(1-3), 98-109
     doi.org/10.1016/j.chemphys.2008.10.036
  5. Caldeweyher, E.; Bannwarth, C.; Grimme, S.
     Extension of the D3 dispersion coefficient model
     J. Chem. Phys. 2017 147 , 034112
